      {
        "name": "places/ChIJNRrgSW4BBDQRa_vKGip84ME/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xkTVlVWjZhRUY1YlZkdVlVSlVka0paZW5kM2FHYxAB",
        "relativePublishTimeDescription": "10 個月前",
        "rating": 4,
        "text": {
          "text": "📍咖吔 Kaya Singapore Casual Dining @kayadining\n\nseaview and promenade raise  standards for these Singapore flavours. can’t miss out the herbs and spices.\n\n北角匯二期地舖嘅獅城風味，裝修明亮，以綠同木系做主調🪵 外面有開揚海景 🌊\n\n🍜 Penang Stir Fried Silver Needle Noodle with Pork 檳城地道老鼠粉 $88\n“wok hei” showstopper! the silver needle noodles are evenly coated in rich, dark soy sauce. the staff even reminded us to be careful how sizzling it was.\n\n「鑊氣」代表作！銀針粉炒得乾身, 每條都沾滿濃濃嘅黑醬油 ⚫️ 有大牌檔嘅風味\n\n🍚 Stir Fried Galangal Pork Neck with Rice in Chicken Oil 南香汁炒豬頸肉配油香飯 $86\nThe pork neck was quite chewy to bite through. it was mildly sweet and spicy. the rice lacked fragrance and fell a little flat in texture.\n\n豬頸肉比較韌, 有啲難咬開 。帶少少甜同微辣，非常開胃。油香飯反而唔特別香, 口感有啲遜色\n\n￼📍咖吔 Kaya Singapore Casual Dining\n\n北角｜北角渣華道123號北角匯二期地下G09號舖\nShop G09, G/F, Harbour North Phase 2, 123 Java Road, North Point",
          "languageCode": "zh-Hant"
        },
        "originalText": {
          "text": "📍咖吔 Kaya Singapore Casual Dining @kayadining\n\nseaview and promenade raise  standards for these Singapore flavours. can’t miss out the herbs and spices.\n\n北角匯二期地舖嘅獅城風味，裝修明亮，以綠同木系做主調🪵 外面有開揚海景 🌊\n\n🍜 Penang Stir Fried Silver Needle Noodle with Pork 檳城地道老鼠粉 $88\n“wok hei” showstopper! the silver needle noodles are evenly coated in rich, dark soy sauce. the staff even reminded us to be careful how sizzling it was.\n\n「鑊氣」代表作！銀針粉炒得乾身, 每條都沾滿濃濃嘅黑醬油 ⚫️ 有大牌檔嘅風味\n\n🍚 Stir Fried Galangal Pork Neck with Rice in Chicken Oil 南香汁炒豬頸肉配油香飯 $86\nThe pork neck was quite chewy to bite through. it was mildly sweet and spicy. the rice lacked fragrance and fell a little flat in texture.\n\n豬頸肉比較韌, 有啲難咬開 。帶少少甜同微辣，非常開胃。油香飯反而唔特別香, 口感有啲遜色\n\n￼📍咖吔 Kaya Singapore Casual Dining\n\n北角｜北角渣華道123號北角匯二期地下G09號舖\nShop G09, G/F, Harbour North Phase 2, 123 Java Road, North Point",
